From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shadeydev <233503709+shadeydev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:59:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] web: hide upstream's mobile store links until this build has
 its own app

Intent: Settings (the Mobile app row and its search entry) and the Welcome page's Phone section must not send people to upstream's App Store and Google Play apps, which connect to upstream's T3 Connect, not this build's. One flag, MOBILE_APP_PUBLISHED in apps/web/src/branding.ts, hides them; the strings stay in the source so the translation catalogs don't change.

Kind: temporary. Drop it (or set the flag and point the links at our app) once this build's own mobile app is in TestFlight.

Check: apps/web/src/components/settings/settingsSearch.mobileApp.test.ts, and the phone test in WelcomePage.import.browser.test.tsx, which asserts the hidden Phone section while the flag is false; in the app, Settings > About has no Mobile app row, and searching "App Store" finds nothing.
Fork-Patch: hide-mobile-store-links.patch

diff --git a/apps/web/src/branding.ts b/apps/web/src/branding.ts
index bf5b76f0dd1b7a4dd698ea943eaa0cc0520c2b82..a007165acd7e459ac3c0916dc6320106475bdc4e 100644
--- a/apps/web/src/branding.ts
+++ b/apps/web/src/branding.ts
@@ -33,3 +33,7 @@ export const APP_VERSION = import.meta.env.APP_VERSION || "0.0.0";
 export const DESKTOP_DOWNLOAD_URL = "https://t3.codes/download";
 // Redirects to the App Store or Google Play to match the phone that opens it.
 export const MOBILE_APP_URL = "https://t3.codes/mobile";
+// This build's own mobile app isn't in the stores yet, and the store apps above don't connect to
+// this build's T3 Connect. While false, the store links, their QR codes and the Welcome page's
+// phone setup stay hidden.
+export const MOBILE_APP_PUBLISHED = false;
diff --git a/apps/web/src/components/onboarding/WelcomePage.import.browser.test.tsx b/apps/web/src/components/onboarding/WelcomePage.import.browser.test.tsx
index 5615fa30818420e211e74a261c54c3a4c4fd7694..4922f7f95b8f89b5ea4c220ca3dc12bdb6243e76 100644
--- a/apps/web/src/components/onboarding/WelcomePage.import.browser.test.tsx
